00:02:11.173 --> 00:02:12.799
For me as a cinematographer,

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:15.260
Robert Richardson:
I search for something
extraordinarily real. 

00:02:15.302 --> 00:02:18.055
Robert Richardson:
Antoine and I felt that what had
been accomplished in the 

00:02:18.055 --> 00:02:21.224
Robert Richardson:
past with color is something we
didn’t want to repeat.  

00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:24.353
Robert Richardson:
So we looked for a palette that
