00:02:40.869 --> 00:02:42.079
Robert Richard:
Peter’s constantly on the run, 

00:02:42.079 --> 00:02:44.706
so his camera is virtually
always the same: 

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:46.333
Robert Richardson:
always in motion. 

